    q: "What does an SEO company in the Niagara Region do?",
    a: "We help businesses across Niagara improve how they appear in Google, the map pack and AI-generated answers. That usually includes Google Business Profile work, service and location pages, technical fixes, reviews, internal linking and answer-ready content. The scope is agreed after reviewing your market, website and competition.",
  },
  {
    q: "Do you have an office in Niagara?",
    a: "Infused Agency is based in St. Catharines, Ontario, and works with businesses throughout the Niagara Region. We meet locally where it is useful and work remotely where that is more practical. We do not invent satellite offices or local addresses.",
