  {
    q: "How is this page different from your Niagara city pages?",
    a: "This page covers businesses that serve several municipalities or need a regional plan. The city pages cover town-level search intent in places such as St. Catharines, Niagara Falls, Welland and Grimsby. The pages link to each other rather than repeating the same copy with a different place name.",
  },
  {
    q: "What is local SEO in Niagara?",
    a: "Local SEO is the work of helping a business appear for nearby searches, especially in the map pack and for town-specific queries. It includes an accurate Google Business Profile, clear service and coverage information, reviews, local pages and a website that search engines can crawl and understand.",
  },
  {
    q: "What are AI SEO, GEO and AEO?",
    a: "AI SEO is the broader effort to improve how a business appears in AI-generated answers. GEO stands for generative engine optimization, the practice of appearing in AI responses. AEO stands for answer engine optimization, which focuses on the direct answers assistants give. They overlap with SEO because they depend on clear content, consistent facts, structured data and trusted signals.",
  },
  {
    q: "Can you get my business recommended by ChatGPT?",
    a: "We can improve the conditions that make a recommendation more likely: consistent business details, crawlable service and location content, structured data, genuine reviews and direct answers to buyer questions. We cannot guarantee that ChatGPT, Gemini, Google AI Overviews or any other assistant will cite or recommend a specific business.",
  },
  {
    q: "How do you improve visibility in Google AI Overviews?",
    a: "We make the important facts easy to find and quote: clear service descriptions, location and coverage information, concise answers to common questions, structured data and strong internal links. We also baseline the answers currently shown for your market and compare them later. AI answers change, so no agency can promise a permanent citation.",
  },
  {
    q: "How much does SEO cost in the Niagara Region?",
    a: "Cost depends on your competition, website, services and how many communities you want to target. We review the business first and send a written quote with a clear scope. We do not publish invented package prices or promise a fixed number of leads.",
  },
  {
    q: "How long does SEO take for a Niagara business?",
    a: "Foundation improvements can show within a few months, while competitive service terms usually take longer. Your starting visibility, website quality, review profile and how consistently the work is maintained all affect the pace. We report progress against agreed measures rather than guaranteeing a date.",
  },
  {
    q: "Do you guarantee rankings or AI recommendations?",
    a: "No. Search results vary by location, device and query, and AI assistants change how they gather and present sources. We commit to the work, transparent reporting and honest recommendations, not a guaranteed position or a guaranteed AI mention.",
  },
];

const data = {
