      "That is why we keep the regional picture and the town-level picture separate. Our [SEO services page](/seo) covers the discipline. The city pages cover St. Catharines, Niagara Falls, Welland, Port Colborne, Niagara-on-the-Lake, Fort Erie, Grimsby, Beamsville, Thorold, Pelham, Fonthill, Smithville, West Lincoln, Wainfleet and Crystal Beach. This page is for businesses that serve more than one of those places, sell to customers across the peninsula, or need a regional plan before deciding which local pages to build.",
