      "AI search has changed the question from \u201cwhich page ranks?\u201d to \u201cwhich business does the assistant trust enough to mention?\u201d When someone asks for an SEO company in Niagara, a contractor near St. Catharines or a clinic in Niagara Falls, the answer is assembled from sources the model can read: your website, Google Business Profile, reviews, directories and third-party mentions. ChatGPT search, Gemini, Perplexity and Google AI Overviews do not all work the same way, but they share a preference for clear, consistent and verifiable information.",
      "The work is less mysterious than the acronyms suggest. Generative engine optimization (GEO) and answer engine optimization (AEO) both depend on the same foundations as SEO: a crawlable site, distinct service pages, accurate location information and content that answers real questions. We add entity cleanup, structured data, direct answers and internal links so the important facts are easy to extract. For Niagara businesses, that often means making the relationship between the regional page, city pages and service pages explicit.",
      "We do not promise that ChatGPT will recommend you, or that Google AI Overviews will cite you. Those systems change, and no agency controls their output. We do commit to measuring a baseline, improving the inputs, and reporting what changed rather than showing a single screenshot as proof.",
